  "history": [
    {
      "date": "2026-02-23",
      "description": "开始受到毒药法术影响：承受完整伤害，移速和攻速降低效果按通常值的 70% 生效。此规则后来在四月调整。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://supercell.com/en/games/clashofclans/blog/release-notes/the-february-update-has-escaped/",
      "sourcePublishedOn": "2026-02-23"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-04-27",
      "description": "Made the Smasher affected by the Poison Spell, but its effects only apply by 30%. Poison Effect"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-04-27",
      "description": "守卫被冻结时，不再触发激活。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://supercell.com/en/games/clashofclans/blog/release-notes/the-sound-of-clash-update/",
      "sourcePublishedOn": "2026-04-27"
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    "The Smasher is one of the default Guardians who is unlocked at Town Hall 18.",
    "He has a violent temper and is fiercely protective of the Town Hall, and will become enraged, boosting his damage and movement speed by 60% if the Town Hall is destroyed. This enraged status persists until he is defeated."
  ],
